    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This spacious three-bedroom townhouse extends to approximately 115 sq.m. and is situated in the popular Athlumney Wood development. Its generous living accommodation offers a practical layout for family life.\n\nThe property has parking to the front and enjoys an open outlook across a large green area. To the rear is a paved, low-maintenance garden with gated access.\n\nAthlumney Wood is conveniently located for the shops, schools and amenities of Johnstown and Navan, with access to the M3 at Junction 8 nearby.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining room, guest WC, three bedrooms, one ensuite, and a family bathroom.\n\nFEATURES\n• Spacious three-bedroom townhouse extending to approximately 115 sq.m.\n• Open outlook across a large green area\n• Parking to the front\n• Paved rear garden with gated access\n• Gas central heating\n• Convenient to Johnstown and Navan Town Centre\n• Easy access to the M3 Motorway\n\nFIXTURES & FITTINGS\nAll flooring, curtains, blinds and appliances are included in the sale.\n\nACCOMMODATION\nEntrance Hall-5'6\" x 12'9\"\nWith wooden flooring.\n\nLounge-11'5\" x 18'8\"\nWith wooden flooring, feature mantelpiece with open fire.\n\nKitchen-15'5\" x 11'1\"\nWith tiled flooring, built in wall and floor units, fridge/freezer, oven, hob and extractor fan.\n\nGuest w.c.-5'2\" x 3'3\"\nWith tiled flooring, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 1-15'5\" x 11'9\"\nWith carpet and a fitted wardrobe.\n\nEnsuite-6'10\" x 8'6\"\nWith tiled walls and flooring, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 2-15'1\" x 10'2\"\nWith carpet and a fitted wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3-15'1\" x 10'2\"\nWith laminate flooring and a fitted wardrobe.\n\nBathroom-5'6\" x 8'2\"\nWith tiled walls and flooring, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nDIRECTIONS\nEIRCODE: C15 TX4Y"
      },
